	$\tau^W_a(\tilde{u})=UD_aU^\dagger$, which is a projector.
	The fibers of $h\mapsto h\cdot\tilde{u}$ partition $\F_q^M$, so
	$\sum_a\tau^W_a(\tilde{u})=\sum_h\tau^W_h=\Id$.
\end{proof}

